    "detailed_description": "Master Heroes is an advanced  Multiplayer First Person Shooter (FPS) game, including all the basics and some advanced systems that all multiplayer shooters requires.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game framework is very polished and utilizing the latest Unity Game eEngine technologies with high efficiency and performance. Including a professional UI using UGUI, player Mechanism animations, and plenty of options to customize to your taste and needed .<br />\r\nIt contains shop to buy coins to use buy new weapons from unity api to buy from iOS .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUtilizing the Photon Unity Networking as network solutions, you have 3 different game modes in the core of the kit: Free for All, Team Death Match and Capture the Flag. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, there are 4 player classes that you can modify to your taste and 6 different kinds of weapons: Rifle, Sniper, Shotgun, Pistol, Grenade, and Knife. This kit is AAA Graphics-Ready. You can easily customize your character, level up, enhance weapon and enhance armor.",
